{"seq":2,"slug":"adme","title":"吸收分布代谢排泄","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/foundations/adme","wordCount":1876,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"吸收分布代谢排泄\">吸收分布代谢排泄</h1><p>同样向一片湖里排放等量的两种农药，一种几天内被微生物分解殆尽、在鱼体内查不到残留，另一种却在鱼的脂肪里逐年累积、最终在水鸟蛋壳里被检出。两者外暴露剂量相同，命运却南辕北辙。决定差异的不是「排了多少」，而是物质进入生物体之后经历的四个过程：吸收（Absorption）、分布（Distribution）、代谢（Metabolism）、排泄（Excretion），合称 ADME，也就是毒物动力学（toxicokinetics）的主线。<a href=\"dose-response\">剂量-反应关系</a> 给出的是外剂量与效应的统计对应，而 ADME 解释的是外剂量如何被转换成真正作用于靶器官的内剂量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>毒物动力学回答「机体对毒物做了什么」，与之对偶的毒物效应动力学（toxicodynamics）回答「毒物对机体做了什么」。ADME 四过程共同决定了一条「内剂量随时间变化」的曲线，曲线下面积（AUC）和峰浓度往往比外暴露剂量更能预测毒性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[外暴露&lt;br/&gt;口服/吸入/皮肤] --&gt; B[吸收 Absorption&lt;br/&gt;跨膜进入血液]&#10;  B --&gt; C[分布 Distribution&lt;br/&gt;血流+亲脂性决定去向]&#10;  C --&gt; D[代谢 Metabolism&lt;br/&gt;I相+II相生物转化]&#10;  C --&gt; E[靶器官蓄积]&#10;  D --&gt; F[排泄 Excretion&lt;br/&gt;肾/胆汁/呼气]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[体内残留 vs 清除]\">flowchart TD\n  A[外暴露&lt;br/&gt;口服/吸入/皮肤] --&gt; B[吸收 Absorption&lt;br/&gt;跨膜进入血液]\n  B --&gt; C[分布 Distribution&lt;br/&gt;血流+亲脂性决定去向]\n  C --&gt; D[代谢 Metabolism&lt;br/&gt;I相+II相生物转化]\n  C --&gt; E[靶器官蓄积]\n  D --&gt; F[排泄 Excretion&lt;br/&gt;肾/胆汁/呼气]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[体内残留 vs 清除]</pre><p>四个过程的核心驱动因素可以汇成一张表，后面各节逐一展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过程</th>\n<th>主导因素</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>吸收</td>\n<td>暴露途径、脂溶性、电离状态</td>\n<td>生物利用度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"../fate-exposure/exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布</td>\n<td>血流、蛋白结合、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分布容积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"../fate-exposure/bioaccumulation\">生物富集与放大</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代谢</td>\n<td>CYP450 酶活、物种差异</td>\n<td>清除率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CL</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"toxicity-mechanisms\">毒性作用机制</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排泄</td>\n<td>肾功能、胆汁、分子量</td>\n<td>半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9703em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"吸收-跨越生物膜的第一道关\">吸收：跨越生物膜的第一道关</h2><p>物质要产生系统性毒性，先得穿过生物膜进入血液。绝大多数污染物靠<strong>被动扩散</strong>跨膜，遵循 Fick 定律——通量正比于膜两侧的浓度梯度、膜对该物质的渗透性以及接触面积。脂溶性（常用辛醇-水分配系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表征）越高，越容易溶入磷脂双层；但太过亲脂又难以离开膜进入水相的血液，因此吸收效率往往在中等亲脂性时最佳。</p>\n<p>弱酸弱碱型污染物的吸收还受 pH 影响：只有未电离的中性分子能自由扩散，电离比例由 Henderson-Hasselbalch 方程决定。这解释了为什么胃（强酸）与小肠（近中性）对同一物质的吸收差异巨大。</p>\n<p>暴露途径决定了「首过效应」是否发生：口服吸收的物质先经门静脉进入肝脏，可能在到达全身循环前就被大量代谢，使生物利用度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 远低于 1；而吸入与皮肤途径绕过肝首过，相同外剂量下内剂量可能高得多。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一参数在环境介质中的迁移意义见 <a href=\"../fate-exposure/transport-transformation\">环境迁移与转化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布-亲脂性如何决定去向\">分布：亲脂性如何决定去向</h2><p>进入血液后，物质随血流分配到各组织。分布的不均匀性主要由两件事决定：组织血流灌注速率，以及物质对不同组织成分的亲和力。亲脂性高的污染物倾向于在脂肪组织富集，这正是 <a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a> 能在体内长期蓄积的根源。</p>\n<p>血浆蛋白结合是另一个关键调节器。与白蛋白等血浆蛋白结合的部分通常无法跨膜、无法被代谢或滤过，只有游离部分才具生物活性。因此两种物质竞争同一结合位点时，一种可把另一种「顶替」出来，瞬间提高其游离浓度而增强毒性。</p>\n<p>宏观上用<strong>表观分布容积</strong>刻画分布的广度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>体内总量</mtext><mtext>血浆浓度</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_d = \\frac{\\text{体内总量}}{\\text{血浆浓度}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">血浆浓度</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">体内总量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远大于实际体液体积，说明物质大量离开血液、蓄积于组织（典型如亲脂性 POPs）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近血浆体积，说明物质主要滞留在循环系统。一些屏障——血脑屏障、胎盘屏障——会选择性地限制分布，但许多小分子亲脂污染物仍能穿过，这是发育毒性与神经毒性的暴露前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代谢-解毒还是激活\">代谢：解毒还是激活</h2><p>生物转化的本意是把亲脂、难排泄的外来物变成更亲水、易随尿液排出的形式，通常分两相协同。</p>\n<p><strong>I 相反应</strong>引入或暴露出极性基团（氧化、还原、水解），主力是肝脏的细胞色素 P450（CYP450）酶系。<strong>II 相反应</strong>把 I 相产物或母体分子与内源性极性分子（葡萄糖醛酸、硫酸、谷胱甘肽等）结合，大幅提高水溶性。</p>\n<p>但代谢是一把双刃剑：很多污染物本身毒性不强，却在 I 相被「代谢激活」成活性更高的中间体——多环芳烃被 CYP450 氧化成能与 DNA 共价结合的环氧化物，正是其致癌性的来源。这类「生物活化」是 <a href=\"toxicity-mechanisms\">毒性作用机制</a> 的核心环节之一。</p>\n<p>CYP450 酶活在物种、个体、年龄间差异极大，并可被其他化学物质诱导或抑制。这种酶活差异是动物实验数据外推到人时不确定性的主要来源，也是 <a href=\"../risk/testing-regulation\">毒理学测试与法规</a> 中体外代谢系统试图弥补的环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排泄动力学与-pbpk-建模\">排泄动力学与 PBPK 建模</h2><p>排泄把物质或其代谢物清出体外，主要经肾（随尿）和肝（随胆汁入肠），挥发性物质还可经呼气排出。分子量与亲水性决定主导途径：小而亲水的走肾，大而亲脂的常经胆汁。胆汁排泄还可能遭遇<strong>肠肝循环</strong>——物质随胆汁入肠后被重吸收回血，显著延长其滞留时间。</p>\n<p>最常用的清除模型是一级动力学，体内浓度按指数衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(t) = C_0 \\, e^{-k_e t}, \\qquad t_{1/2} = \\frac{\\ln 2}{k_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2543em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9703em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是判断蓄积潜力的关键：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9703em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以小时计的物质即使持续暴露也难以蓄积，而某些 PFAS 在人体内的半衰期以年计，使得即便低水平暴露也会逐渐累积，这与 <a href=\"../pollutants/emerging-microplastics\">新兴污染物与微塑料</a> 中讨论的 PFAS 监管困境直接相关。</p>\n<p>为把上述四过程整合并跨物种、跨剂量外推，现代毒理学使用<strong>生理药代动力学（PBPK）模型</strong>：用一组微分方程把身体表示为以真实血流量、组织体积和分配系数连接的多个房室。到 2026 年，OECD 与各监管机构在新方法学（NAMs）框架下越来越多地接受 PBPK 模型，将体外测得的浓度-效应关系反向外推到等效人体外暴露剂量（IVIVE），从而减少对整体动物试验的依赖，详见 <a href=\"../risk/testing-regulation\">毒理学测试与法规</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ADME 四过程把外暴露剂量转换为真正作用于靶器官的内剂量，是连接暴露与效应的桥梁。</li>\n<li>吸收由暴露途径、脂溶性与电离状态决定，口服途径的首过效应可大幅降低生物利用度。</li>\n<li>分布受亲脂性、蛋白结合与生理屏障调控，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反映物质蓄积于组织还是滞留于血液。</li>\n<li>代谢既能解毒也能生物活化，CYP450 的物种与个体差异是跨物种外推不确定性的主因。</li>\n<li>排泄半衰期决定蓄积潜力，PFAS 以年计的半衰期是其监管难题的动力学根源。</li>\n<li>PBPK 模型整合四过程，支撑当前 NAMs 框架下从体外数据反推人体安全剂量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"吸收分布代谢排泄","id":"吸收分布代谢排泄"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"吸收：跨越生物膜的第一道关","id":"吸收-跨越生物膜的第一道关"},{"level":2,"text":"分布：亲脂性如何决定去向","id":"分布-亲脂性如何决定去向"},{"level":2,"text":"代谢：解毒还是激活","id":"代谢-解毒还是激活"},{"level":2,"text":"排泄动力学与 PBPK 建模","id":"排泄动力学与-pbpk-建模"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"剂量-反应关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/foundations/dose-response"},"next":{"title":"毒性作用机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/foundations/toxicity-mechanisms"}}